// 014.4: `Regime` initial-state parameter overlays resolve against declared `Param`s
// and round-trip through `charter fmt`.
Param quorum-min = 3.
Param timelock-window : Duration = 7.

Regime baseline {
  quorum-min = 3,
  timelock-window = 7
}.

Regime emergency-high {
  quorum-min = 5,
  timelock-window = 14
}.

Fact council Identified by C1.
Fact votes Identified by Int.
Act adopt Actor council Related to votes
  Holds when votes >= quorum-min.

Scenario default-regime-uses-initial-param {
  +votes(3).
  ?lawful adopt(C1, 3).
}
